    "Name": "Celerity CLR-02-X-D",
    "Details": "While not mounting any defensive weaponry, the Celerity CLR-02-X-D's head is equipped with a  Drone Remote Control System and carries a C3i module. The fact the 'Mech has no MechWarrior piloting it is a good thing given the Celerity's single ton of armor and the fragile nature of its XXL engine and XL gyro, even a single skid following a misstep would almost cripple the design let alone combat fire on the battlefield. The standard design carries no weapon, but this version has been altered to mount a single Small Laser.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Quad Mech (Squad)</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
